    "detailed_description": "Thabit mercilessly rules his kingdom in the land of Egypt, until one day he is struck by a heavy blow of fate.<br />\r\nThe gods Isis and Osiris take pity on the young pharaoh: by building a magnificent city that offers shelter to many contented inhabitants, Thabit can change his fate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReturn to the world of Ancient Egypt and build a magical city! Earn gold and materials to be able to build houses and temples. <br />\r\nCollect trophies and bonuses so you can upgrade and beautify all the buildings.<br />\r\nHarness the four elements of water, earth, wind and fire and put your match-3 skills to work, as you'll soon have formidable powers at your disposal to advance the construction of yourcity and attract many inhabitants!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n   - Enchanting Match-3 game with a captivating story<br />\r\n   -  More than 100 exciting levels with many extras<br />\r\n   - Earn trophies and complete mini games<br />\r\n   -  Construct a glorious city!",
